>> Our monthly feed cost is about dollars.

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:29.240
>> That's it?

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:30.840
And what does it take to scale?

00:00:29.240 --> 00:00:32.080
>> One of the things that helped us grow is

00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:33.600
a piece of equipment that you'd never

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:35.880
expect to find [music] on a farm.

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:36.640
>> Oh, yeah? And how do you sell all this

00:00:35.880 --> 00:00:38.600
meat?

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:41.440
>> We actually say no to most restaurants

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:43.200
who want to buy our beef because

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:45.160
>> What? We're here to find out how they

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:47.280
started a farm with absolutely zero

00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:48.800
experience and [music] how you can, too.

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:50.680
