store in a blind taste test [music] to

00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:03.560
see if Vicky can tell which one is

00:01:02.880 --> 00:01:06.120
which.

00:01:03.560 --> 00:01:07.200
>> I think this one might [music] be ours.

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:07.920
>> Okay.

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:08.640
Oh.

